        {
          "op": "seek",
          "mode": "rapid",
          "script": "gap=50,120,+10,+10,+10,-30,+10",
          "final_s": 130,
          "_note": "6 requests at 50ms: 120,130,140,150,120,130 - forward burst + a back jump. gap=50 is the D-pad AUTO-REPEAT cadence, and it has to beat a whole seek or nothing coalesces: since the seek became a plain av_seek on the demux thread (was a socket interrupt + reopen that never fired) a 4K HEVC seek anchors inside one frame, so the old 300ms burst ran six independent seeks and covered the merge path zero times."
